{{Quote|Designed for forward observers coordinating long-range decrees. This medium suit features, integrated adaptive camouflage capabilities and an asymmetrical optic visor, ensuring hostile movements are cataloged meticulously--and discreetly--before being permanently stricken from state records.|[[Armory]] Description}}

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[Armor#Medium-0|medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Both the [[Armor#Armor-0|armor]] and [[Armor#Helmet-0|helmet]] can be claimed on page 2 of the [[Scope of Authority Premium Warbond#Page 2|Scope of Authority Premium Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|55|notext}} and {{Currency|Medals|45}}, respectively.

